WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
The repository-scoped connection lets GitHub events
reach the right First Tree work.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
An Issue assignment becomes a Source Chat
for the assignee’s Agent.

00:09.000 --> 00:15.000
The Issue context moves with the Agent—
without rebuilding the task.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.000
A linked pull request keeps delivery
attached to its source Issue.

00:22.000 --> 00:31.000
Review, approval, and merge return to the same Chat,
preserving the work’s history.
